            "                           n features  CV AUC  CV log loss  log loss sd\n",
            "a. raw columns                   15.0  0.7320       0.3804       0.0109\n",
            "b. + education one-hot           17.0  0.7322       0.3804       0.0105\n",
            "c. + all flags                   22.0  0.7277       0.3825       0.0102\n",
            "d. b minus redundant/weak        13.0  0.7339       0.3792       0.0101\n",
